    "processingDescription": "Private complete schema-2 virtual-robot fixture. This supersedes the rejected V14 candidate: its 0.015 kg body was paired with 1.2 m-chord wings, yielding D24 fixed-body loads up to 5.52 N and 3.25 N m and an invalid free release. V15 restores a compact 0.56 m total span, 0.14-to-0.09 m tapered wing, 0.015 kg total-mass ledger, 0.002 kg per-wing rigid-plate properties, and body inertias sized for that packaged robot. The 3 Hz bilateral waveform is an authored control baseline, not a biological measurement. It is unqualified: D3Q19 fixed-body force balance, coupled release, refinement, momentum closure, and Numi policy training remain separate gates. This is not a measured Deetjen or biological specimen."
